.TH OWNED 10 "October 2026" "1.1" "Neverdark Manual"
.SH NAME
owned \- List the objects a player owns
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B owned
.RI [ player ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
List every object owned by you, or by the named player.
.B owned me
is yourself. Each object is printed by name with its reference, and the
listing ends with a count of objects found.
.PP
Listing another player's holdings is scoped, never a way to enumerate the
world: you must rule the region that player is standing in, and only objects
standing in regions you can reach are shown. Your own listing shows
everything you own.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR examine,inventory,here (10)
.SH AUTHOR
quirinpa <quirinpa@tty.pt>
